# .claude/ is personal AI tooling (OpenWolf skills, rules, commands) except
# settings.json, which carries the hooks every contributor should get, and the
# skills this repo owns. A negation cannot reach inside an ignored directory, so
# each level has to be un-ignored before the level below it can be.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/nagi-design/
